sequenceDiagram
    participant GS as GameStateMachine
    participant WP as WaveProgressionSystem
    participant SS as SpawnEntrySchedulerSystem
    participant SP as SpawnRequestProcessingSystem
    participant MS as Mob and Combat Systems
    participant BR as Bridges and HUD
    GS->>WP: BeginStage()
    WP->>SS: Activate current wave
    loop For each spawn entry
      SS->>SP: Enqueue SpawnRequest
      SP->>MS: Instantiate enemy Entity prefab
      MS->>BR: Create and bind visual model
    end
    loop While enemies are alive
      MS->>MS: Chase player and update movement
      MS->>MS: Fire projectiles and apply damage
      MS-->>BR: Damage, VFX, and XP events
    end
    BR-->>WP: Updated alive count
    WP->>WP: Complete wave or activate next wave
    WP-->>GS: StageCompleted
